<title>USA: Global Telemedia names Terry Huetter CFO.</title>
<headline>Global Telemedia names Terry Huetter CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global TeleMedia International Inc on Monday sid that Terry Huetter has been named chief financial officer, effective June 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Huetter succeeds Herbert Perman, who continues as a director and executive vice president of the company.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Global, Huetter was a financial and general management consultant.</p>
</text>
